<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - BCH Q3 1996 profit to rise 25.4%.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - BCH Q3 1996 profit to rise 25.4%.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a consensus of analyst forecasts for BCH 1996 third quarter results. (billions of pesetas unless stated):</p>
<p>   BCH				 Q3 1996   Q3 1995	 RANGE</p>
<p>   Net attributable		28.51     22.73    26.34 - 31.42</p>
<p>   Net interest income	  210.70    198.68   207.88 - 212.8</p>
<p>   Operating margin		76.16     96.02    71.60 - 80.95</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTORS: Benito y Monjardin, BSN, Ahorro Corporacion, AB Asesores and ABN AMRO.</p>
<p>NOTE: BCH will announce its 1996 3Q results between Oct. 24-25.</p>
</text>
